            We publish them because it saves everyone the wrong call. If the numbers below are not in your
            range, you know before you reach out. If they are, the conversation starts from a shared
            baseline instead of a negotiation.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Contract terms — front and centre -->
